<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-FAI takes 40 pct of Indonesian insurer.</title>
<headline>RTRS-FAI takes 40 pct of Indonesian insurer.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAI Insurances Ltd said on Friday that its Hong Kong subsidiary, FAI First Pacific Insurance Co Ltd, has taken a 40 percent stake in Hastin Insurance Co Ltd, an Indonesia-based insurance company.</p>
</text>
